  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) Ramonyai Borena Watt a Woman Cooperative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Remote and rural communities in South Africa are often off the grid and do not have access to reliable energy. Morwesi is working to overcome energy poverty in rural communities by empowering women to invest in energy generation facilities and in the process create more sustainable lives with an additional revenue stream.</narrative>
  </description>
